{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Only the blood you shall not eat.</b> Even though I said to you that you have no sprinkling of blood on the altar for it — you shall not eat it." "<b>You shall pour it out like water.</b> To tell you that it does not require covering (Sifrei; Ḥullin 4). Another interpretation — it is like water for preparing seeds (ibid. 35)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:46:44.761443860Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}